@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor "用户" as User
participant "Fcitx5" as Fcitx
participant "Voime addon" as Addon
participant "voimed" as Daemon
participant "目标应用" as App

note over Fcitx, Addon
  Mode=continuous：不读取、不消费 Hotkey。
end note

Daemon -> Addon : SegmentStarted { source: continuous }
Addon -> Addon : 绑定当前焦点

loop 语音期间
  Daemon -> Addon : Partial
  Addon -> Fcitx : setPreedit(Partial)
  Fcitx -> User : 临时窗口
end

Daemon -> Addon : Final
Addon -> Fcitx : 清空 preedit
alt 目标仍聚焦
  Addon -> Fcitx : commitString(Final)
  Fcitx -> App : 插入文本
else 目标失焦 / 销毁
  Addon -> Addon : 不提交\n保留历史
end
@enduml
